  english:
    title: 'F Class '
    message: Class F fires involve burning cooking oils and fats, commonly found
      in kitchens. Using water can cause the fire to spread rapidly. Class F extinguishers
      or fire blankets should be used for safe intervention.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6db6f8e6d462b30459ac099413eca75f, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: F SINIFI
    message: "F s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 yang\u0131nlar, k\u0131zg\u0131n ya\u011Flar\u0131n
      tutu\u015Fmas\u0131yla olu\u015Fur ve mutfaklarda s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr.
      Su ile m\xFCdahale edilmesi yang\u0131n\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCt\xFCr. Bu nedenle
      F s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 t\xFCpler veya yang\u0131n battaniyesi kullan\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 646efff88e63cee449c047b7d5ed54c7, type: 2}
